ddressbook><name>KAJIWARA, TOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NORIKURA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATOU, NORIHITO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TABATA, HIDEKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAKURA, YOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YASUDA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A cold rolling mill the productivity of which is improved by installing a strip wiper preferable for high-speed rolling and which is free from dust and foreign matters. A wiper roll is floated and supported by an air hydrostatic bearing of two-pocket type, and the range of load of the floating force is variably adjusted in accordance with the width of the strip, thus drastically enhancing the wiping capacity. By applying a wiping device the rolling speed of which is more than 700 m/min which cannot be achieved by conventional roller wipers and tube wipers to a cold rolling mill, the productivity of the cold rolling mill and the quality of the surface of the rolled material are greatly improved, and the effect is very strong.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Laminoir à froid dont on améliore la productivité au moyen du montage d'un dispositif d'essuyage des feuillards conçu, de préférence, pour un laminage très rapide et exempt de poussière et de corps étrangers. On met en flottaison un rouleau d'essuyage supporté par un palier hydrostatique pneumatique à deux poches et on règle la plage de charges de la force de flottaison de façon variable en fonction de la largeur du feuillard, ce qui augmente considérablement la capacité d'essuyage. La mise en application d'un dispositif d'essuyage dont la vitesse de roulement est supérieure à 700 m/min, ce qui ne peut être atteint par des rouleaux ou des cylindres d'essuyage classiques dans un laminoir à froid, permet d'améliorer considérablement la productivité de ce dernier, ainsi que la qualité de la surface du matériau laminé, grâce à l'effet puissant exercé par ce dispositif.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>